{"id":"n58195-1-7","stage":1,"title":"종류 · 种类","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58195-1-7-1","ko":"난 시끄러운 음악은 싫어.","zh":"我讨厌吵闹的音乐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시끄러운","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음악은","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]},{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"讨厌","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不中意。","pronunciation":["실타"]}],"audio":"/audio/289554fd72cd6aecf2fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58195-1-7-2","ko":"넌 조용한 종류의 음악을 좋아하나 보구나.","zh":"看来你喜欢安静类型的音乐啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용한","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종류의","meaning":"种类","explanation":"종류：种类；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"종류","audio":"/audio/2e6adf4ec98d68239960.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58195","senseId":"1","lemma":"종류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음악을","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하나","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"安静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"听不见任何声音。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]},{"id":"2e6adf4ec98d6823","term":"종류","zh":"种类","audio":"/audio/2e6adf4ec98d68239960.mp3","entryId":"58195","definition":"根据某种标准，分为多条的门类。","pronunciation":["종ː뉴"]},{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1cdd93ecd452cd562ec5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58195","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来你喜欢安静类型的音乐啊。","为什么要去面包店啊？","我讨厌吵闹的音乐。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来你喜欢安静类型的音乐啊。","我讨厌吵闹的音乐。","为什么要去面包店啊？"],"answer":0}]}
